    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The community sits in the southwestern foothills of Tiger Mountain, surrounded by evergreen wilderness and mid‑20th‑century cabins.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        16,
        26
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1",
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.mirrormont.org/about-mirrormont"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Washington State Route 18 skirts the southeast edge of Mirrormont, linking it to Interstate 90 and Auburn.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mirrormont%2C_Washington"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Mirrormont Community Association, founded over fifty years ago, maintains the area’s unique character and property values.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        21
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.mirrormont.org/about-mirrormont"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Mirrormont’s name evokes the image of mirrored reflections in the nearby mountain vistas, a theme highlighted in early sales brochures.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        21
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.mirrormont.org/about-mirrormont"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "The area has seen a shift in development, with larger homes appearing in Cedar Grove, the Highlands at Tiger Mountain, and Mirrormont over the last decade.",
